### Birds of a Feather

At the end of each day (20:30 UTC), there will be a Birds of a Feather (BoF) session in each track, where you can gather for unstructured discussion of the project, related topics, content that was delivered during the day, or, really, anything at all.
Tuesday 20:30 UTC
Cassandra 4.0 benefits, upgrading, and the road ahead
Patrick McFadin, Aaron Ploetz, Melissa Logan, Audra Carter

Join a discussion between Apache Cassandra gurus Patrick McFadin and Aaron Ploetz as Mellissa Logan digs deep with them into Cassandra 4.0 benefits, upgrade, and more. Bring your questions to this interactive discussion, and you won't want to miss the fun cocktail / mocktail session at the end! 


